#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:2
msgid "Install the Mattermost Android mobile app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:7
msgid ""
"Take Mattermost wherever you go by `installing the Mattermost mobile app "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mattermost.rn>`_ on "
"your Android mobile device running Android 7.0 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:9
msgid "On your device, visit the Play Store."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:10
msgid "Search for \"Mattermost\" and select **INSTALL** to download the app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:11
msgid ""
"Open Mattermost from your homescreen and enter your team and account "
"information to login:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Enter Server URL:** This is the web address you go to when you want to "
"access Mattermost. See the :doc:`access your workspace </end-user-"
"guide/access/access-your-workspace>` documentation for additional "
"details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:14
msgid ""
"Enter your credentials as specified by your Mattermost system admin. "
"Select **Log in**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:18
msgid ""
"You can set up multi-factor authentication for Mattermost if your system "
"admin has :ref:`enabled your ability to do so <administration-"
"guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:enable multi-factor"
" authentication>`. See the :doc:`manage security preferences </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences>` documentation for "
"details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:21
msgid "Mattermost on Chromebooks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:23
msgid ""
"Mattermost Android mobile app for Android isn't supported on Chromebooks."
" While some Android applications can run on ChromeOS devices, the "
"Mattermost app isn't optimized for this environment and may not function "
"as expected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-android-app.rst:25
msgid ""
"For the best experience on Chromebooks, we recommend accessing Mattermost"
" through the web app using the Chrome browser. Alternatively, ChromeOS "
"users can also choose to install the web app as a Progressive Web App "
"(PWA) directly from the browser for an app-like experience with a desktop"
" icon and windowed view."
msgstr ""

